# Purpose: inspect Scale, return, then edit and restore Tempo in an explicit RAM fixture.
# Expect: capture_changed:overview=music, capture_changed:tempo=tempo_changed
# Expect: semantic:music:property=music, semantic:scale:value_label=music_scale
# Expect: semantic:tempo:property=transport, semantic:tempo:target_index=0
0 scenario macro-performance-rail
200 button LEFT_TOP down
400 encoder NAV 0.01
500 encoder NAV 0.01
600 encoder NAV 0.01
800 button LEFT_TOP up
1100 capture screen overview
1300 button LEFT_CENTER down
1450 encoder NAV 0.01
1700 button LEFT_CENTER up
1800 capture screen music
1900 tap NAV 60
2200 capture screen scale
2300 tap LEFT_TOP 60
2600 capture screen music_return
2700 button LEFT_CENTER down
2850 encoder NAV 0.01
3100 button LEFT_CENTER up
3300 capture screen tempo
3500 encoder OPT 1
3700 capture screen tempo_changed
3800 encoder OPT -1
4000 capture screen tempo_restored
4100 encoder NAV 0.01
4400 encoder NAV 0.01
4600 capture screen clock
4700 encoder NAV -0.01
5000 encoder NAV -0.01
5300 capture screen tempo_return
